{
  "name": "Othuki - Agente de Prospecção WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "evolution-webhook",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1",
      "name": "Webhook Evolution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 400],
      "webhookId": "evolution-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.data.key.fromMe }}",
              "rightValue": false,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b2",
      "name": "É do Lead? (fromMe=false)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "name": "phone",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.data.key.remoteJid || '').split('@')[0] }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "name": "name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.pushName || 'Lead' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.message.conversation || ($json.body.data.message.extendedTextMessage && $json.body.data.message.extendedTextMessage.text) || '' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3",
      "name": "Extrair Dados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [700, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.AGENT_URL }}/api/agent/inbound",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "phone", "value": "={{ $json.phone }}" },
            { "name": "name", "value": "={{ $json.name }}" },
            { "name": "message", "value": "={{ $json.message }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4",
      "name": "Chamar Agente Othuki",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [940, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.reply }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "isNotEmpty" }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e5",
      "name": "Tem Resposta?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1180, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_URL }}/message/sendText/{{ $env.EVOLUTION_INSTANCE }}",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
            { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_API_KEY }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "number", "value": "={{ $json.body.leadId }}" },
            { "name": "text", "value": "={{ $json.body.reply }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f6",
      "name": "Enviar via Evolution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1420, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Como usar este workflow\n\n1. Importe no n8n do seu VPS.\n2. Defina as variáveis de ambiente (Settings > Environment):\n   - AGENT_URL = http://SEU_HOST:3000  (onde roda este projeto node)\n   - EVOLUTION_URL = https://seu-evolution.com.br  (sem barra no fim)\n   - EVOLUTION_INSTANCE = nome da instância\n   - EVOLUTION_API_KEY = sua apikey\n3. No painel da Evolution API, aponte o webhook da instância para:\n   https://seu-n8n.com/webhook/evolution-webhook\n4. Ative o workflow. Mensagens recebidas caem no agente (que agenda ou escala p/ humano) e a resposta é enviada de volta pelo WhatsApp.\n\nObs: o agente roda em modo simulação por padrão (não envia WhatsApp real nem cria evento real). Troque WHATSAPP_PROVIDER=evolution e configure Google Calendar para produção real."
      },
      "id": "g7",
      "name": "Instruções",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 200]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Evolution": {
      "main": [ [ { "node": "É do Lead? (fromMe=false)", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ]
    },
    "É do Lead? (fromMe=false)": {
      "main": [ [ { "node": "Extrair Dados", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] 
    },
    "Extrair Dados": {
      "main": [ [ { "node": "Chamar Agente Othuki", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ]
    },
    "Chamar Agente Othuki": {
      "main": [ [ { "node": "Tem Resposta?", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ]
    },
    "Tem Resposta?": {
      "main": [ [ { "node": "Enviar via Evolution", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": { "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false, "instanceId": "othuki-prospeccao" },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "version": 1
}
